          "@type": "ListItem",
          position: 3,
          name: "GNC Protein Powder Review",
          item: `${SITE_URL}/gnc-protein-powder-review/`,
        },
      ],
    },
    {
      "@type": "FAQPage",
      mainEntity: [
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "Is GNC protein powder good?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "GNC AMP Wheybolic is a good, mainstream whey. Per GNC's labels, a two-scoop serving gives 40 g of protein in about 200 to 220 calories with little fat or sugar. It is not more potent than other whey, just a bigger serving. Its value depends on price: on a GNC sale it is competitive; at full price, rivals are usually cheaper per gram."
